# CITATION.cff - how to cite this project in a report or paper.
# GitHub shows a "Cite this repository" button on the project page because of this file.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Docker Compose Demo: Running Multi-Container Applications"
abstract: >-
  A fully automatic, narrated classroom demonstration of Docker Compose, Git and GitHub.
  One script starts a four-container application (NGINX, MySQL, Adminer, BusyBox), explains
  every command in simple English, checks every result, cleans up safely, writes a results
  report, uploads it to the user's own GitHub account, verifies the upload and signs out again.
authors:
